              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 4,
                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to WesternGeco LLC, congress enacted \u00a7\u202f271(f) to prohibit the domestic supply of components that are combined abroad in a way that would constitute infringement if performed in the United States."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "84523d702c6971305b3c621eccb6e8ad4a7aa8b36525ea548dc89d0d06291f09",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-84523d702c69-0002-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 46,
                "start": 46
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The petitioner argues that the rule applied to \u00a7\u202f271(a) should also apply to \u00a7\u202f271(f)."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "WesternGeco LLC (Petitioner)",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    },
    {
      "claims": [
        {
