              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-84523d702c69-0000-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 7,
                "start": 7
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to ION Geophysical Corporation, the foreign combination of the components does not constitute infringement of a U.S. patent, making the presumption against extraterritoriality a better fit for this case."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "ION Geophysical Corporation (Respondent)",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
